.AeonRecyclingHolds","kind":"opaque","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-boundary-generates-chart.lean#L25-L31","doc":"**The aeon-recycling Prop.**\n\nOpaque proposition asserting the conjecture's content: for the\ngiven parameter type `V` (the projective fibre over which the\nbundles live), the composition `Φ_1^q ∘ CMB` is well-defined\non `π₀(Bun°)` and lands back inside `Bun°(ℙ(V))`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}